Section: libdevel
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/vomlehn/tcs-xtce
Description: packet runtime for code tcs-xtce generates, and CCSDS time codes
 Tcsxtce is what the packet code tcs-xtce generates from a mission's XTCE
 runs on, aboard a vehicle and in the mission operations center: the
 packet runtime and the digest two programs check each other's XTCE
 with, header-only for C and C++ and as a Python 3 package. tcsccsds's
 CCSDS time codes for C, C++ and Python come with it.
 .
 This package is operational code alone, under /opt/tcs; the compiler
 that generates the code is the tcs-xtce package.
